{"5019180":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Epic Seven","steam_appid":5019180,"required_age":"15","is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019180\/extras\/fc0625693b5dc1ac8348fc7714d949e9.poster.avif?t=1793256460\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019180\/extras\/fc0625693b5dc1ac8348fc7714d949e9.webm?t=1793256460\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019180\/extras\/fc0625693b5dc1ac8348fc7714d949e9.mp4?t=1793256460\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><strong> <\/strong><br> <br><strong>● PLAY THE ANIMATION — An anime RPG enjoyed by 20 million players worldwide!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diche, the Goddess of Life, shared her power to bring the Heir of the Covenant and the Guardians into this world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Heir, protect the world.&quot; — We invite you to the Seventh World, an epic saga crafted by master storytellers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Seven is a Hero collection RPG that blends hand-drawn, full-frame 2D animation with deep, strategic turn-based combat. Collect and build hundreds of unique Heroes, and experience battles that play like a cinematic anime.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019180\/extras\/678709b1e07ea2e8022b1b1c9d9249f9.poster.avif?t=1793256460\" width=820 height=460 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5019180\/extras\/678709b1e07ea2e8022b1b1c9d9249f9.webm?t=1